    "source": "WinLove's own look: type, density, radii, spacing and raised cards since 2026-11-10 (D-136), colours since 2026-11-11 (D-137)",
    "generated": "2026-11-11",
    "notes": "Colours are WinLove's own since 2026-11-11 (D-137; were the reference tool's measured greys, D-109): neutral surfaces with a slight cool (slate) bias. Dark: a deep page (bg.base) under the frame (title bar, ribbon band, status bar, navigation card: bg.titleBar / bg.chrome) and the content card (bg.panel), groups raised on it (bg.raised), inputs inset (bg.input), push buttons lighter (bg.control). Light: the same order (the page the deepest, cards white). One accent fill per accent in both themes carrying white text (the default Mavi #3070D9 as the other four); accent.text / accent.focus are its readable tone per theme; accent.subtle is the selection fill (the accent over the panel). Status colours one set per theme with subtle fills; icon and template (tier) colours tuned to the same family. Text on every surface: >= 4.5:1 (primary, secondary, accent text, status), >= 3:1 (tertiary) - tests/ui/PaletteTests.cpp. Type, density, radii and spacing: D-136 (13px Segoe UI, 28 rows and controls, 32 navigation items, cards 10, controls 6, 20 between cards, elevation.card). High contrast keeps its own set. See docs/DECISIONS.md D-109, D-136, D-137."
  },
